It is half past six in the morning.
My mobile phone rings loudly.
That is my alarm.
I wake up slowly.
Outside it is still dark.
The morning in Berlin is very quiet.
I am still a little tired.
The bed is warm and cosy.
But I get up right away.
I turn on the light.
Then I take my mobile phone.
I turn off the alarm.
A new workday begins.
I go straight into the bathroom.
There I begin my day.
